{"title": "Fire Hallucination", "pageid": 50658, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fire_Hallucination", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the action which summons the creature. For the creature itself, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Hallucination_(creature)\" title=\"Fire Hallucination (creature)\">Fire Hallucination (creature)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fire Hallucination</b> is a conditional action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thisobald\">Thisobald</a>. He can use this action once after using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Regurgitation\" title=\"Acidic Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acidic Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Regurgitation\" title=\"Acidic Regurgitation\">Acidic Regurgitation</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nMagically inebriated as he is, <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thisobald\">Thisobald the Brewer</a> is hallucinating flaming imps into existence.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wi